#. Description of the plugin
#: advery-reviews.php
msgid "Fast, self-contained ratings & reviews for any post type, taxonomy term, or WooCommerce product. Collects reviews in its own optimized tables (not one comment split across many meta rows), reads WooCommerce's native ratings, and — when Advery Schema Plus is active — injects aggregateRating/review into the JSON-LD graph. Configurable submission rules, a smooth React moderation panel, a dashboard widget, a pending-count menu badge, and instant + digest email reports."
msgstr ""

